    "The voice test checks the microphone, the speech model, the voice, the ear, headphones and the brain, and says what failed. Measurements record latency, echo and end-of-turn decisions while Live runs; the log holds no transcript.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The voice test checks the microphone, the speech model, the voice, the ear, headphones and the brain, and says what failed. Measurements record latency, echo and end-of-turn decisions while Live runs; the log holds no transcript."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le test vocal vérifie le micro, le modèle de reconnaissance, la voix, l'écoute, les écouteurs et le cerveau, et dit ce qui a échoué. Les mesures enregistrent la latence, l'écho et les décisions de fin de phrase pendant Live ; le journal ne contient aucune transcription."
          }
        }
      }
